<item><title>Female artisanal miners in Kono report systemic sexual violence</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/female-artisanal-miners-in-kono-report-systemic-sexual-556e1d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/female-artisanal-miners-in-kono-report-systemic-sexual-556e1d/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>Women working in abandoned diamond and gold pits in Jaiama Nimikor face persistent threats of rape and harassment while seeking a livelihood.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:35:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone charcoal burners cut down fruit trees, EPA official says</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burners-cut-down-fruit-trees-epa-a237a3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burners-cut-down-fruit-trees-epa-a237a3/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>Only 36% of Sierra Leoneans have access to electricity and just 15% have clean cooking, according to the government&apos;s National Energy Compact.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:35:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burners-cut-down-fruit-trees-epa-a237a3/share.jpg" length="43474" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burners-cut-down-fruit-trees-epa-a237a3/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Civil society group demands dismissal of Sierra Leone&apos;s finance minister</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/civil-society-group-demands-dismissal-of-sierra-leone-s-c955ed/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/civil-society-group-demands-dismissal-of-sierra-leone-s-c955ed/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>A coalition calling itself the CSOs Consortium on Public Accountability says Finance Minister Sheku Ahmed Fantamadi Bangura should be removed immediately.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:35:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone&apos;s vice presidency has never led to the presidency</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-vice-presidency-has-never-led-to-the-b42fab/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-vice-presidency-has-never-led-to-the-b42fab/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>Analyst Foday M. Daboh argues the office has repeatedly failed as a route to power, and questions whether the current vice president is already too late.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:35:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
